# Provenance and notices

This repository is a public, reconstruction-focused packaging of experiments originally
run in a larger private `dusty-lm` workspace. It is not a copy of that workspace's Git
history.

## Original model and runtime

The model architecture and inference conventions come from DustyLM by Mahmood Khordoo:

- <https://github.com/khordoo/dusty-lm>
- Source checkpoint: <https://huggingface.co/mkhordoo/dusty-8m-sft>
  at revision `43d341f16f17cbeefedfe2475582942ab5891ed1`

`src/dusty_wsp/model.py` is a minimal copy of the original scratch GPT implementation,
retained so the checkpoints load without the full training/data pipeline. The original
DustyLM code and this repository are MIT-licensed; see `LICENSE`.

## Historical research notes

The files in `docs/reports/` are imported research notes. They were path-sanitized
(absolute workspace paths replaced, relative links adjusted, a provenance note added).
Their hashes therefore differ from the original notes. Numbers and claims were not
rewritten.

