## Model-assisted labels

The stairs semantic labels were produced by a single model (`openrouter` /
`deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017`) and are explicitly model-assisted, not human
review. They are preserved under `evidence/stairs/` with their labeling method.

## Checkpoints

No model checkpoint is redistributed. The 31 MB pinned source can be downloaded with
`dusty-wsp download-source`; the two edited checkpoints can be reconstructed exactly
from the pinned source plus the JSON factors in `evidence/`.
